     "items": [
      "**Pure Sine Wave $x(t) = A\\sin(\\omega_0 t)$:** Single eternal oscillation. Contains zero energy at any frequency other than $\\omega_0$. Spectrum consists of two discrete lines (impulses) at $\\pm \\omega_0$.",
      "**Constant DC Signal $y(t) = C$:** Zero rate of change. All energy resides at zero frequency ($\\omega = 0$). Spectrum is an impulse $2\\pi C \\delta(\\omega)$.",
      "**Rectangular Pulse $z(t)$:** An isolated pulse switches abruptly from OFF (0) to ON ($A$) and back to OFF (0). These instantaneous transitions demand high-frequency components that extend infinitely along the frequency axis ($\\omega \\to \\infty$). Thus, its spectrum is continuous and infinite in extent."
     ]
