       "t": "math",
       "tex": "X(\\omega) = \\int_{-\\infty}^\\infty \\delta(t)\\,e^{-j\\omega t}\\,dt = \\left. e^{-j\\omega t} \\right|_{t=0} = e^0 = 1"
