       "text": "$X(f) = \\frac{1}{2+j 2\\pi f}$. Replacing $f \\to t$ creates the signal $z(t) = \\frac{1}{2+j 2\\pi t}$ (NOT $\\frac{1}{2+jt}$!).  \n  Its transform is:"
