     "t": "math",
     "tex": "\\text{rect}\\left(\\frac{t}{\\tau}\\right) \\stackrel{\\mathcal{FT}}{\\longleftrightarrow} \\tau \\, \\text{Sa}\\left(\\frac{\\omega\\tau}{2}\\right) \\quad \\iff \\quad \\frac{\\sin(at)}{\\pi t} = \\frac{a}{\\pi}\\text{Sa}(at) \\stackrel{\\mathcal{FT}}{\\longleftrightarrow} \\text{rect}\\left(\\frac{\\omega}{2a}\\right)"
