     "text": "**Source Material:** PrepFusion Titans Classroom Chalkboard Lecture Series  \n**Target Examination:** GATE 2027 / 2028 (ECE, EE, IN)  \n**Document Designation:** `audit_ch4_slides_225_256.md`  \n**Prerequisites:** Continuous-Time Fourier Transform (CTFT) Properties, Frequency Response of LTI Systems, Duality & Convolution Theorems."
