       "t": "math",
       "tex": "H(\\omega) = \\begin{cases} \\frac{1}{2} - \\frac{1}{2} = 0, & \\pi \\le |\\omega| \\le 3\\pi \\\\ \\frac{1}{2} - 0 = \\frac{1}{2}, & 0 \\le |\\omega| < \\pi \\text{ and } |\\omega| > 3\\pi \\end{cases}"
