     "text": "**Chalkboard Statement:**\nA periodic continuous-time square wave $x(t)$ with period $T_0 = 3\\text{ s}$ is applied to an LTI system with impulse response $h(t)$. Over one fundamental period $t \\in [0, 3]$, $x(t)$ is defined as:"
