        "Output contains only the pair at $\\pm 1\\text{ Hz}$ with weight $(A f_s) \\times \\frac{1}{f_s} = A = 1.5$.",
        "Result: $y(t) = 3\\cos(2\\pi t) = m(t)$. (**LPF: SUCCESS $\\checkmark$**)"
